${C}  ╔╗ ╦╔═╗╦═╗╔═╗╔═╗╔╦╗${N}  ${D}quickstart guide${N}
${C}  ╠╩╗║╠═ ╠╦╝║ ║╚═╗ ║${N}
${C}  ╚═╝╩╚  ╩╚═╚═╝╚═╝ ╩${N}

${B}WHAT IS BIFROST?${N}

  A terminal workspace that spans multiple machines over Tailscale.
  You launch it from one machine (${C}Heimdall${N}), and it creates
  tmux sessions on your other machines (${R}Realms${N}) over SSH.
  Then you can attach to any session from anywhere — even your ${Y}phone${N} (${Y}Raven${N}).

${B}THREE ROLES${N}

  ${C}Heimdall${N}   ${D}─${N}  The guardian. Your primary machine.
                Runs bifrost, manages everything.
